Season 2 : Guilty Party ( 2017 ) ( edit ) Slasher 's 8 - episode second season centers around a horrific secret that a group of former summer camp counselors have buried long ago . Due to a changing circumstance , they must return to their resort in the dead of winter to retrieve the body of Talvinder , whom they murdered while they were camp counsellors , five years earlier . They get surprised when they ca n't find the body at the campsite . Later , the group start dying one by one at the hands of a mysterious person wearing a parka , which also alerts the second group of counselors at the resort . Eventually , it 's revealed that Judith is the killer , and another character , Wren , is actually Owen `` Wren '' Turnbull , her son who committed suicide after being framed for Talvinder 's murder , and is a figment of Judith 's imagination . Owen wrote a letter to his mother , asking her to get justice for him before hanging himself .","entities":["Slasher","Season 2: Guilty Party","Owen "Wren" Turnbull","group of former summer camp counselors","summer camp","campsite","Talvinder's murder","killings at the resort","Owen's suicide","letter to his mother","Judith","Talvinder","resort"],"facts":["Slasher -RELATED_TO-> English","Slasher -RELATED_TO-> Anthology","Slasher -RELATED_TO-> Slasher","Slasher -RELATED_TO-> Super Channel","Slasher -LOCATED_IN-> Ontario"]}
