Go Tell It on the Mountain ( song ) - wikipedia Go Tell It on the Mountain ( song ) Jump to : navigation , search Go Tell It on the Mountain by unknown Genre Christmas , spiritual Language English Published 1909 `` Go Tell It on the Mountain '' is an African - American spiritual song , compiled by John Wesley Work , Jr. , dating back to at least 1865 , that has been sung and recorded by many gospel and secular performers . It is considered a Christmas carol because its original lyrics celebrate the Nativity of Jesus : `` Go tell it on the mountain , over the hills and everywhere ; go tell it on the mountain , that Jesus Christ is born . '' Recording artists ( edit ) This section needs additional citations for verification . Please help improve this article by adding citations to reliable sources . Unsourced material may be challenged and removed .","entities":["English","Christmas","John Wesley Work, Jr.","spiritual","Nativity of Jesus","Go Tell It on the Mountain","Jesus Christ"],"facts":["English -LOCATED_IN-> South Africa","English -LOCATED_IN-> Africa","English -RELATED_TO-> language compensation","English -RELATED_TO-> Permanent immigration to the area","English -LOCATED_IN-> Namibia"]}
