When the news was eventually picked up by media outlets , and Inditex , Zara 's owning company , was asked to comment on the issue , Inditex replied that the items in question have been suspended from sale , and that they are in contact with Bassen 's lawyer to clarify and address the issue . In November 2017 , customers shopping at Zara stores in Istanbul , Turkey found handwritten notes purportedly from Turkish workers in the pockets of in - store garments asking shoppers to pressure Zara into paying them the wages they claim they are owed . Stores ( edit ) There are over 2,100 Zara stores located across 88 countries . Zara usually selects the best located and most expensive real estate locations in the world to open its flagship stores . Zara 's flagship stores : Fifth Avenue , New York Oxford Street , London Calle Serrano , Madrid Via del Corso , Rome Champs - Élysées , Paris Oscar Freire Street , Sao Paulo Corso Vittorio Emanuele , Milan Nevsky Prospect , Saint Petersburg Shibuya and Ginza , Tokyo Myeongdong in Seoul Flora Fountain in Mumbai The number of Zara stores in each country ,","entities":["New York","Seoul","Tokyo","Turkey","Paris","Inditex","Bassen","Istanbul","Turkish workers","customers","Customers finding handwritten notes in Zara garments","handwritten notes","Fifth Avenue","Oxford Street","Calle Serrano"],"facts":["New York -PART_OF-> US","Rochester -PART_OF-> New York","Brooklyn -PART_OF-> New York","Mount Pleasant -PART_OF-> New York","New York -PART_OF-> United States"]}
