The Greek film directed by Ismene Daskarolis ( 2014 ) places it in the economical crisis of Greece today . The Mexican film Nosotros los pobres includes this tale as a small sub-plot . There is also a Bulgarian short film adaptation known as `` Darovete na vlahvite '' ( 2013 ) directed by Ivan Abadjiev . An off - Broadway musical version entitled The Gifts of the Magi premiered at Lamb 's Theatre in New York City in 1984 . Written by Mark St. Germain and Randy Courts , the play is regularly produced in schools and regional theaters . In 1955 , in The Honeymooners episode 13 of season 1 , `` ' Twas the Night Before Christmas '' involves Ralph looking for the perfect present for Alice for Christmas . Without money , he pawns his prized bowling ball to buy her an expensive gift , only to find out in the end that she bought him a custom bowling ball bag .","entities":["Alice","Greece","New York City","Christmas","schools","The Gift of the Magi","Greek film","Ismene Daskarolis","economical crisis","Nosotros los pobres","Darovete na vlahvite","Ivan Abadjiev","The Gifts of the Magi","Mark St. Germain","Randy Courts"],"facts":["Alice -LOCATED_IN-> the kitchen","Alice -LOCATED_IN-> woods","Alice -RELATED_TO-> Rabbit","Alice -RELATED_TO-> Tweedledum","Alice -LOCATED_IN-> Rabbit's house"]}
