More than one song was used as the theme song . Season 1 episodes feature the song `` When We 're Singin ' '' , which was replaced in subsequent seasons with `` C'mon Get Happy '' . `` Five of us , and Mom working all day , we knew we could help her if our music would pay , Danny got Reuben to sell our song , and it really came together when Mom sang along ... '' ( from `` When We 're Singin ' '' ) Later , under Farrell 's direction , the new version had new lyrics sung to the `` When We 're Singin ' '' tune . With the new chorus finalized , `` C'mon Get Happy '' showcased the new verse : `` We had a dream , we 'd go travelin ' together , We 'd spread a little lovin ' then we 'd keep movin ' on .","entities":["Reuben","Farrell","Danny","The Partridge Family","When We're Singin'","C'mon Get Happy","Mom"],"facts":["David Cassidy -RELATED_TO-> Farrell","Farrell -LOCATED_IN-> jail","Reuben -RELATED_TO-> Rob Paulsen","Frank -RELATED_TO-> Farrell","Danny -LOCATED_IN-> Texas"]}
