[E39988a] {"title":"Celebrity Big Brother (U.S. TV series)","text":"Celebrity Big Brother (U.S. TV series)
This season aired during the winter of the 2017 -- 18 network television season on CBS and was the second U.S. Big Brother season to air outside the usual summer television season , the first being Big Brother 9 in 2008 . Julie Chen returned as host , with Allison Grodner and Rich Meehan returning as executive producers . The season was produced by Fly on the Wall Entertainment in association with Endemol Shine North America . The season premiered on February 7 , 2018 . The promotional logo was released on December 20 , 2017 . The logo is similar to that used for Big Brother season 19 , with the word `` celebrity '' added . The first teaser was also released the same day . In January 2018 official photos of the house and backyard were released through a press release and an Instagram livestream with Julie Chen . On January 28 , 2018 , the official cast was announced during The 60th Annual Grammy Awards .","entities":["Press Release","Instagram","house","Allison Grodner","Rich Meehan","Fly on the Wall Entertainment","Endemol Shine North America","Big Brother 9","Big Brother season 19","Celebrity Big Brother promotional logo","Celebrity Big Brother first teaser","backyard","Celebrity Big Brother official photos","Instagram livestream with Julie Chen","The 60th Annual Grammy Awards"],"facts":["Press Release -RELATED_TO-> GreenDay.com","Austria -RELATED_TO-> Press Release","GreenDay.com -RELATED_TO-> Press Release","Press Release -RELATED_TO-> Advanced Technology Demonstration Program","DirecTV.com -CREATED-> Press Release"]}
