On March 9 , 2015 , AMC announced it had ordered Fear the Walking Dead to series , with a two - season commitment . The second season , comprising 15 episodes , premiered on April 10 , 2016 . The season follows a dysfunctional , blended family composed of high school guidance counselor Madison Clark , her English teacher fiancé Travis Manawa , her daughter Alicia , her drug - addicted son Nick , Travis ' son from a previous marriage , Chris , Chris ' mother Liza Ortiz , and others who join their group at the onset of the zombie apocalypse . Contents ( hide ) 1 Cast 1.1 Main cast 1.2 Supporting cast 2 Episodes 3 Production 3.1 Development 3.2 Casting 3.3 Filming 4 Reception 4.1 Critical response 4.2 Ratings 5 Home media releases 6 References 7 External links Cast ( edit ) Main cast ( edit ) Kim Dickens as Madison Clark : A high school guidance counselor , Travis ' girlfriend , Alicia and Nick 's mother , and Chris ' stepmother .","entities":["AMC","zombie apocalypse","Fear The Walking Dead","Fear the Walking Dead (season 1)","Fear the Walking Dead season 2","Fear the Walking Dead series order announcement","Premiere of the second season","Madison Clark","Chris","Travis Manawa","Liza Ortiz","Nick","Alicia","Kim Dickens"],"facts":["AMC -RELATED_TO-> Jeep","AMC -RELATED_TO-> The Walking Dead pilot episode","AMC -RELATED_TO-> AMC renewal of The Walking Dead","AMC -RELATED_TO-> Breaking Bad","AMC -RELATED_TO-> The Walking Dead animated film"]}

